319 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (the car. Normally, the turbulent air left by the car is explosive and uncontrolled, creating a low-pressure zone, which has a negative effect; however, the teeth help convert this turbulence into organised eddies and vortices\(which are used positively in this case\), which turn back and crash into the car, further propelling it forward, converting something negative into something positive.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [44]
>>
