551 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (within the software environment, helping us simulate real-world conditions. We generated a complete 3-axis toolpath covering all critical surfaces and features of the car body. The stock dimensions were modelled directly using official STEM Racing model block specifications to maintain manufacturing compliance. Tool clearances and cutter trajectories were closely analysed and refined to ensure no collisions or incomplete cuts would occur during actual production. This simulation enabled us to iterate and refine designs with confidence, saving both time and material in later stages.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [42]
>>
endobj
