/Pg 16 0 R
/K [19 20]
>>
endobj
555 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (complications, as the design would not conform to the available stock dimensions specified under STEM Racing regulations. Early identification of this issue through CAM validation allowed the team to modify the design accordingly and bring the width within the permissible 65 millimetre limit. This proactive correction prevented potential delays and material loss during manufacturing.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [45]
>>
endobj
